  "question": {
    "text": "The lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math> are coplanar, if:",
    "image": null
  },
